C14 \\sim C15 \\sim C16 \\sim C17: within 1.7A with sigma of 0.04 and sigma for
terminal atoms of 0.08
Uanis(C17) \\sim Ueq, Uanis(C16) \\sim Ueq, Uanis(C15) \\sim Ueq, Uanis(C14)
\\sim Ueq: with sigma of 0.1 and sigma for terminal atoms of 0.2
4.a Aromatic/amide H refined with riding coordinates:
 C12(H12), C25(H25), C10(H10), C21(H21), C11(H11), C24(H24), C22(H22), C3(H3),
